# Class Check (before delivery)

Run this checklist on the lesson file. Fix failures before push.

## Sync
- [ ] Full-text paragraphs === gap-fill paragraphs (word-for-word; only blanks differ)
- [ ] Word banks shuffled (not text order); exactly 5 words / 5 blanks per block
- [ ] T/F answerable only from listening text (no outside knowledge traps)
- [ ] T/F balance ~50/50 (e.g. 5 True + 5 False on 10 items); do not make almost all True

## Grammar
- [ ] Hour’s grammar focus matches `curriculum/25-hours.md` for this class number
- [ ] Grammar Review + Grammar Box teach the same focus
- [ ] Highlight grammar lines colours only the listening sentences used in Grammar Review; the same spans are in the full text and the gap text; the legend matches section 3; highlighting is off until the button is pressed
- [ ] At least one recycle of a prior tense/structure appears in dialogue or listening

## App behavior
- [ ] Unique `localStorage` key for this class
- [ ] Every task has **Check the answers** and **Clear** in English (gap fill, transforms, grammar review, true/false, dialogue, personal writing, grammar box, matching)
- [ ] Check always writes the correct answer (`Correct answer:` or `Correct: T/F`), including when the student was right
- [ ] Grammar Review answers disappear on the first keystroke, then stay hidden until the next check
- [ ] Section Clear wipes that task only and does not ask to confirm; global Clear Answers does
- [ ] Full-text Listen reads all four paragraphs once; each Gap Fill block Listen uses Repeat (1×/2×/3×, default 1×) and Speed (0.75 / 0.92 / 1.1, default 0.92)
- [ ] Each True/False subsection Listen plays its listening paragraphs twice at 0.92 and ignores the Gap Fill repeat/speed
- [ ] Listen becomes Stop while that clip is playing; Stop cancels speech and ignores the rest of the queue
- [ ] Matching has 12 items (even 2-column grid); Slovak appears as the option answers, not as button labels
- [ ] No auto `scrollIntoView` on check
- [ ] Hints use `\u` escapes for Slovak diacritics
- [ ] Copy Plain Text exports full lesson; Copy Gap Fill uses blank templates
- [ ] Hub `index.html` lists the class with correct relative URL, and the preview iframe adds a cache-busting `?v=`

## Pedagogy smoke test
- [ ] A grade 8–9 student can finish main tasks in one online hour
- [ ] Instructions and buttons are short and in English
- [ ] About Me / personal output tasks do not require private data beyond school-safe intro
